     1,
     "<div>Hi <br></div><div><br></div><div>I think the LGM is fine for this, you can put the 2 growth curves in the same model, and correlate the latent slpes. These will be the correlations between change over time, can be a little odd to interpret. But is is not an unusual model</div><div>Can also correlate linear, quadratic etc slopes between different growth models. Might see these as coupled growth models for example<br></div>"
